::: flashcard{deck="14-Rocq Programming Language"}
What are the use cases of rocq?
=== key
- As a platform to model programming languages.
- As a tool to write formally certified software and hardware.
- As a functional programming language with dependent types.
- As a proof assistant for higher-order logic.
:::
